  "integration_fixes": [
    "Removed blanket Prefetch2 incompatibilities with Q6 T4 IMMA and Q4 fused T4 IMMA; matching T4 IMMA dispatch has priority and all remaining eligible vector widths use Prefetch2 fallback.",
    "Unified vector kernel template parameters as Prefetch2, Baseline, Rows. Strict benchmark baseline bypasses prefetch, both IMMA routes, old warp-pair route, Q4 async, and alternate decoder flags while preserving W cooperative decode; public product fallback uses native Decoder and optional Prefetch2.",
    "Q6 baseline helper now uses runtime K except Q6_STATIC_K plus K5120 and T in {1,4}.",
    "Fixed K-stream MMQ integration i0 scope by defining i0 before the feature branch and retaining one original fallback body; optimized path is guarded to SM86 Q4_K J128.",
    "Vector timing captures separate 100-operation baseline and candidate CUDA Graphs outside timing, warms and checks exact BF16 outputs, then measures ABBA graph launches with captured_graph metadata.",
    "Added full-head Q6_K K5120 N248320 T1/T4 event cases backed by the pinned q6-k5120 fixture manifest."
  ],
